.TH SDL_GetDeviceFormFactorName 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetDeviceFormFactorName \- Get a short name for the current device.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "const char* SDL_GetDeviceFormFactorName(SDL_FormFactor form_factor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The name will be in English\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I form_factor
the form factor to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a human-readable name for the given form factor, or
.BR "" \(dq SDL_FORMFACTOR_UNKNOWN \(dq
if the form factor isn\(aqt recognized\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

